<title>LATVIA: DAUGAVPILS, LODE GAIN ON STABLE SHARE MKT.</title>
<headline>DAUGAVPILS, LODE GAIN ON STABLE SHARE MKT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA</dateline>
<text>
